# 2. Authentication Command

The `auth` command configures Google Earth Engine access for the package.

## Syntax

```bash
swot-wse auth
```

## Behaviour

Running this command performs the following steps.

1. Requests the Google Earth Engine Project ID.
2. Stores the Project ID in the package configuration.
3. Launches Google Earth Engine authentication if required.
4. Saves authentication credentials locally.

Authentication normally needs to be completed only once.

